===Etymology===
From an {{der|en|alg}} word ''torope'' ("little [[turtle]]"); compare {{cog|abe|tolba||turtle}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of several [[small]] [[turtle]]s, of the [[family|families]] [[Emydidae]] and {{w|Geoemydidae}}, that live in [[fresh]] or [[brackish]] [[water]].

